msgstr "次の設定を確認してください"

msgid ""
"Clear it from storage and also clear the modem's storage area. It cannot be "
"cancelled."
msgstr "保管庫とモデムの保存領域からすべて削除します。取り消せません。"

msgid "Client isolation"
msgstr "クライアント分離"

msgid "Communication between main SSID bands"
msgstr "メインSSIDの帯域間通信"

